From: Vahiru <nekovahiru@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] WifiTrackerLib: default to per-network MAC randomization

crDroid changed StandardWifiEntry.getPrivacy() to return
PRIVACY_RANDOMIZATION_ALWAYS when the entry has no saved configuration.
Restore the AOSP value, PRIVACY_RANDOMIZED_MAC, to match the default for
new networks in patches/android/packages-modules-wifi/0002.

Origin: local
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [device-specific policy]
---
 .../src/com/android/wifitrackerlib/StandardWifiEntry.java       | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libs/WifiTrackerLib/src/com/android/wifitrackerlib/StandardWifiEntry.java b/libs/WifiTrackerLib/src/com/android/wifitrackerlib/StandardWifiEntry.java
index c715b0e..d35f0a9 100644
--- a/libs/WifiTrackerLib/src/com/android/wifitrackerlib/StandardWifiEntry.java
+++ b/libs/WifiTrackerLib/src/com/android/wifitrackerlib/StandardWifiEntry.java
@@ -609,7 +609,7 @@ public class StandardWifiEntry extends WifiEntry {
                     return PRIVACY_RANDOMIZED_MAC;
             }
         } else {
-            return PRIVACY_RANDOMIZATION_ALWAYS;
+            return PRIVACY_RANDOMIZED_MAC;  // AOSP default
         }
     }
 
